ntity, roster, grading, accommodation, payment, or integration changes, verify both the intended path and a user who should remain unaffected before expanding the configuration.\n\n### What information should I send to support?\nSend the page name, approximate time, your role, the affected scope, and a description of expected and observed behavior. Remove learner records and secrets. Include a screenshot only when it contains synthetic data or has been reviewed and redacted.\n:::\n\n[^1]: https://github.com/lextures/lextures\n[^2]: https://lextures.com/platform","author":"chase-willden","reviewer":null,"publishedAt":"2026-08-11","contentUpdatedAt":"2026-08-11","reviewedAt":null,"reviewDueOn":"2027-02-11","primaryQuestion":"How do I use uploading and managing course files in Lextures?","cluster":"help-courses","pillar":"","briefRef":"","verifiedAgainst":"2026-08-11 source","keywords":["Lextures","courses","help"],"relatedTo":["/docs/courses/course-readiness-checklist","/docs/courses/building-modules-and-pages","/docs/courses/editing-the-course-syllabus"],"roles":["instructor"],"segments":["k12","higher-ed","homeschool"],"citations":[],"extra":{"import":{"sourcePath":"www/src/docs/courses/managing-course-files.md","gitSha":"079aacf8fef3b171a54b2063dce723471714b824","importedAt":"2026-08-12T00:00:00Z","lastmodSource":"frontmatter","sourceHash":"e20acc674676ba1ece36483a7b6f297c568de5baf76ef819b7a3eed06be7a998","importedRevision":1,"metadata":{"contentContract":"answer-first-v1","supportTicketThemes":["courses-managing-course-files"]}},"seedMigration":"485"}},{"kind":"doc","slug":"inviting-people-to-a-course","category":"enrollment","path":"/docs/enrollment/inviting-people-to-a-course","title":"Inviting people to a course","description":"Invite learners and educators, assign the intended course role, and resolve pending or expired invitations. Learn the key checks and safe next steps..","bodyMd":"::: key-takeaways\n- Invite learners and educators, assign the intended cou